003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e220-inch modular DVLED wall for dedicated home cinema and entertainment rooms. 8K-capable resolution with ISF calibration. Acoustic transparency allows behind-screen speaker placement. White-glove installation and calibration service included.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the resolution and pixel pitch of the DVLED Residence 220\\u0026quot;?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe DVLED Residence 220\\u0026quot; features an ultra-fine 0.93mm pixel pitch with an 8K resolution of 7680 x 4320, delivering incredibly sharp and detailed images suitable for premium home cinema experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the display and is it suitable for bright room environments?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis model has a peak brightness of 1,000 nits, providing vivid and clear visuals even in well-lit rooms, making it ideal for various lighting conditions common in home entertainment settings.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs the DVLED Residence 220\\u0026quot; easy to install and does it come with professional support?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the product includes a white-glove installation service ensuring expert setup, calibration to ISF Level 3 standards, and seamless integration into your dedicated home cinema or entertainment room.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat kind of warranty is offered with the DVLED Residence 220\\u0026quot;?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe display comes with a comprehensive 5-year on-site warranty, guaranteeing peace of mind and reliable support directly at your location within the GCC region.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"