ch of the DVLED Residence 220&quot;?</h3><p>The DVLED Residence 220&quot; features an ultra-fine 0.93mm pixel pitch with an 8K resolution of 7680 x 4320, delivering incredibly sharp and detailed images suitable for premium home cinema experiences.</p><h3>How bright is the display and is it suitable for bright room environments?</h3><p>This model has a peak brightness of 1,000 nits, providing vivid and clear visuals even in well-lit rooms, making it ideal for various lighting conditions common in home entertainment settings.</p><h3>Is the DVLED Residence 220&quot; easy to install and does it come with professional support?</h3><p>Yes, the product includes a white-glove installation service ensuring expert setup, calibration to ISF Level 3 standards, and seamless integration into your dedicated home cinema or entertainment room.</p><h3>What kind of warranty is offered with the DVLED Residence 220&quot;?</h3><p>The display comes with a comprehensive 5-year on-site warranty, guaranteeing peace of mind and reliable support directly at your location within the GCC region.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"DVLED Residence 220\\\" – Premium LED Display Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover the DVLED Residence 220\\\" ultra-clear display in Dubai. Enhance your space with Brightluxx premium LED solutions. Contact us today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl220\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/bl-dvl220\",\"si