ightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl220\", \"category\": \"dvled\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-dvl220.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 4000, \"highPrice\": 40000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl220\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"0.93mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"7680 x 4320 (8K)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:T9df,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the resolution and pixel pitch of the DVLED Residence 220\\\"?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The DVLED Residence 220\\\" features an ultra-fine 0.93mm pixel pitch with an 8K resolution of 7680 x 4320, delivering incredibly sharp and detailed images suitable for premium home cinema experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display and is it suitable for bright room environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model has a peak brightness of 1,000 nits, providing vivid and clear visuals even in well-lit rooms, making it ideal for various lighting conditions common in home entertainment settings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the DVLED Residence 220\\\" easy to install and does it come with professional support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the product includes a white-glove installation service ensuring expert setup, calibration to ISF Level 3 standards, and seamless integration into your dedicated home cinema or entertainment room.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty is offered with the DVLED Residence 220\\\"?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display comes with a comprehensive 5-year on-site warranty, guaranteeing peace of mind and reliable support directly at your location within the GCC region.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this DVLED compare to traditional projectors or TVs for a home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The DVLED Residence offers superior brightness, infinite contrast, and 8K resolution without the need for darkening the room like a projector. Unlike TVs, it supports seamless modular scaling up to 220 inches with precise color calibration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the display accommodate audio integration for a cinema-quality experience?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it features an Acoustic Transparent (AT) option that allows speakers to be placed behind the screen, delivering immersive sound without compromising picture quality.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this display suitable for applications beyond home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"While optimized for home cinema and entertainment rooms, the DVLED Residence 220\\\" is also ideal for VIP suites and luxury residential lounges seeking a high-end visual centerpiece.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+